# Dystopia: снаряжение Единиц Внешнего Патруля. Prototypes: _Dystopia/Entities/Clothing/{OuterClothing,Head,Masks}/patrol_*.yml

ent-DystopiaPatrolShellLight = light Unit shell
    .desc = Mobile armor of a rank-and-file External Patrol Unit with a shoulder lamp. Class 4, full body. Cannot be removed.
ent-DystopiaPatrolShellCommand = command Unit shell
    .desc = Armor of an External Patrol Command Unit. Class 5, full body. Cannot be removed.
ent-DystopiaPatrolShellPraetorian = Praetorian shell
    .desc = Armor of the Consul's personal guard: class 5, full body, fireproof, blast-resistant and barely restricts movement. Cannot be removed.
ent-DystopiaPatrolShellLightHelmet = light Unit shell helmet
    .desc = Helmet of the light Unit shell. Class 4. Cannot be removed.
ent-DystopiaPatrolShellCommandHelmet = command Unit shell helmet
    .desc = Helmet of the command Unit shell. Class 5. Cannot be removed.
ent-DystopiaPatrolShellPraetorianHelmet = Praetorian helmet
    .desc = Helmet of the Praetorian shell. Class 5, fireproof. Cannot be removed.
ent-DystopiaPatrolMask = Unit face mask
    .desc = A tactical gas mask locked to a Unit's shell. Hides the face, filters air and contagion. Cannot be removed or pulled down.
